OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMore flights delayed after
OL,4,Ahundreds cancelled by air traffic
OL,5,Acontrol glitch
OL,6,
OL,7,FNats, the air traffic control provider,
OL,8,Fblamed a technical glitch and its boss
OL,9,FMartin Rolfe apologised, saying there
OL,10,Fwould be a full investigation after the
OL,11,Ffirm admitted resolving the issue had
OL,12,Ftaken "longer than hoped".
OL,14,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband told the
OL,15,FBBC the situation was "frankly
OL,16,Funacceptable" and Transport Secretary
OL,17,FHeidi Alexander has summoned Rolfe to a
OL,18,Fmeeting to explain what happened.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
